    "name": "Dead Mire",
    "steam_appid": 2406730,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "Dead Mire is a unique atmospheric fast-paced endless wave zombie gore fest.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406730/extras/63f20eee3cb0aa8c2f47d94381f9eb97.poster.avif?t=1707523543\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406730/extras/63f20eee3cb0aa8c2f47d94381f9eb97.webm?t=1707523543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406730/extras/63f20eee3cb0aa8c2f47d94381f9eb97.mp4?t=1707523543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Ammo is scarce so you must use it tactically to dispose of as many zombies as you can with as few shots as possible. You are armed with a double barrel shotgun and you can switch between buckshot, birdshot and slugs which you must choose between wisely to maximize your damage output in any given situation.<br><br>Birdshot gives you a very wide cone but short range, ideal for taking out swarms of zombies grouping you. <br>Slugs have long range and will pass through objects and other zombies but travels in a narrow line, best used when you line up zombies behind one another.<br>Buckshot is a balance between range and width; your bread and butter for taking out zombies along with barrels and crates.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406730/extras/7087a393d19a521a7d4c30fdf1087f73.poster.avif?t=1707523543\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406730/extras/7087a393d19a521a7d4c30fdf1087f73.webm?t=1707523543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406730/extras/7087a393d19a521a7d4c30fdf1087f73.mp4?t=1707523543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Make use of portals and bullet time to extend and break up shots, killing more zombies in a single shot. Ammo and health potions spawn from broken barrels and crates which can also be destroyed with teleported shots, traps and dynamite, maximizing your ammo conservation.<br><br>Compete against other players on the Steam leaderboard to see who can kill the most zombies before they die or run out of ammunition!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406730/extras/9a6543da883b398f4f0f1d9053c4f40f.avif?t=1707523543\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Dead Mire is a unique atmospheric fast-paced endless wave zombie gore fest.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406730/extras/63f20eee3cb0aa8c2f47d94381f9eb97.poster.avif?t=1707523543\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406730/extras/63f20eee3cb0aa8c2f47d94381f9eb97.webm?t=1707523543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406730/extras/63f20eee3cb0aa8c2f47d94381f9eb97.mp4?t=1707523543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Ammo is scarce so you must use it tactically to dispose of as many zombies as you can with as few shots as possible. You are armed with a double barrel shotgun and you can switch between buckshot, birdshot and slugs which you must choose between wisely to maximize your damage output in any given situation.<br><br>Birdshot gives you a very wide cone but short range, ideal for taking out swarms of zombies grouping you. <br>Slugs have long range and will pass through objects and other zombies but travels in a narrow line, best used when you line up zombies behind one another.<br>Buckshot is a balance between range and width; your bread and butter for taking out zombies along with barrels and crates.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406730/extras/7087a393d19a521a7d4c30fdf1087f73.poster.avif?t=1707523543\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406730/extras/7087a393d19a521a7d4c30fdf1087f73.webm?t=1707523543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406730/extras/7087a393d19a521a7d4c30fdf1087f73.mp4?t=1707523543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Make use of portals and bullet time to extend and break up shots, killing more zombies in a single shot. Ammo and health potions spawn from broken barrels and crates which can also be destroyed with teleported shots, traps and dynamite, maximizing your ammo conservation.<br><br>Compete against other players on the Steam leaderboard to see who can kill the most zombies before they die or run out of ammunition!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406730/extras/9a6543da883b398f4f0f1d9053c4f40f.avif?t=1707523543\" /></span>",
